    "text": {
     "en": "India has many languages, religions, foods and dresses, yet we live as one nation. This is unity in diversity.\nFestivals like Diwali, Eid, Pongal, Christmas, Onam and Baisakhi are celebrated across India.\nRespecting other people's customs and helping each other keeps our country united."
    }
